        "subject": "LU-21311 build: Skip modules which already have BTF sections",
        "message": "LU-21311 build: Skip modules which already have BTF sections\n\nThis patch when embedding BTF into (.ko) module, skip\nmodules which already have BTF section. During the search\nfor .ko, this patch also skips temporary kconftest.results\ndirs having configure-test modules\n\nlinux_obj=/lib/modules/6.12.0-124.20.1.el10_1.x86_64/build\nlinux_rel=6.12.0-124.20.1.el10_1.x86_64\n\nBefore Patch:\n-------------\ntime /bin/sh /tmp/embed-btf.sh . $linux_obj $linux_rel\nreal 1m21.477s\nuser 0m50.833s\nsys  0m29.494s\n\nAfter Patch:\n------------\ntime /bin/sh /tmp/embed-btf.sh . $linux_obj $linux_rel\nreal 0m4.882s\nuser 0m2.483s\nsys  0m3.612s\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: I4a16753e8b32cbf7e1efb44ded67096836385470\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
